Another way you can do it is do dig a hole in the wall from the outside, and
then walk in the hole that you dig.  (in case you didn't know this you CAN
dig through the walls of a shop, you just have to keep at it.  Note that it
tells you that the wall SEEMS too hard to dig into.).  When you leave the
shopkeeper will follow you tapping you on the shoulder and saying "Didn't
you forget to pay?".  One intersting event that a friend of mine encountered
was on a ghost level that he found upon which was a shop that the ghost had
robbed.  He passed the shopkeeper in a room and it said to him "Hello dml,
I was looking for gronk".  He found the shop unguarded.

                     
